"P2616935890" "You found a clue to Julianne's whereabouts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1231998059" "Crey security was there? Curious. What do they care about a missing person case that went stale over a decade ago? Perhaps Crey had something to do with Julianne's disappearance? They'd hate to see something like that come out now, right when they're gearing up for the release of their new computer operating system, CreyComp."
// RandomFameString :
"P856142140" "I'm really looking forward to the release of Crey's new OS."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3404782921" "I'm going to have a word with Pamela Thompson. She never told me the other heroes who investigated her daughter's disappearance wound up dead! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>In the meantime, you might as well go talk to that hero mentioned in the missing girl's diary.</A> The Night Fox may have been the last person to see Julianne before she disappeared."
// AcceptString :
"P192933910" "Talk to the Night Fox"
// SendOffString :
"P2102443680" "The Night Fox's retired now, but he still lives in a cave. He was really into the whole brooding hero lifestyle."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2442801105" "Defeat security chief & his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1544241503" "Have you found the Night Fox yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4015107182" "You've known few heroes as dedicated to an image as the Night Fox. Though this cave has been made comfortable, it exudes the image of a loner on the fringe of society."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1596551672" "We should have taken the Night Fox in ages ago."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3735736742" "He'll be a good addition to the Revenant Hero Project."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2478019548" "You're too late! The Night Fox is gone!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P128276702" "The countess wants the place scrubbed for evidence."

