"P1401111179" "Paragon Protector"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P312578252" "Cover our tracks well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1059931075" "Make sure {HeroName} doesn't escape!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P326389679" "You defeated the Crey security, but there is no sign of the Night Fox."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P670435590" "Crey kidnapped the Night Fox? It sounds like we've got more on our hands than a decade-old missing person case. Crey must have had something to do with Julianne Thompson's disappearance! Why else would they be trying to eliminate all our leads?"
// RandomFameString :
"P2756673023" "You remember that old hero, the Night Fox? {ContactName} is saying he's been kidnapped!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P197517186" "<A HREF={ACCEPT}>We've got to find out what Crey has done with that retired hero, the Night Fox.</A> Not only is he in grave danger of becoming another unwilling donor for Crey's disgusting Revenant Hero Project, he's also the only lead we have to the disappearance of Julianne Thompson. I'm beginning to suspect that girl may have fallen victim to some sort of Crey plot. The weird thing is, she disappeared years ago, back when Crey was just a European company of moderate means."
// AcceptString :
"P1962376105" "Find out what Crey has done with the Night Fox"
// SendOffString :
"P1800669675" "One of the Crey agents on the street may know something. If I were you, I'd start looking in Crey's Folly; that's where you'll find most of them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2657086511" "Question agents about kidnapping"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P898673953" "We have nothing to go on, {HeroName}. If you can't find a clue to the Night Fox's location, we're out of luck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P696137764" "You shouldn't stick your nose into the past!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1527046045" "One of the Crey agents you defeated was carrying a set of printed orders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1308654640" "Good work, {HeroName}. These orders you found should lead us right to the facility where the Night Fox has been imprisoned. I really hope he can tell us what happened to Julianne Thompson."
// RandomFameString :
"P1661562967" "My boss already pre-ordered 30 copies of CreyComp for our office."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4087486394" "Well, {HeroName}, you did a great job finding out where Crey took the Night Fox. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now all you have to do is go in and rescue him.</A> With any luck, he'll be able to tell you what happened to Julianne Thompson all those years ago. I'm certain Crey had something to do with her disappearance."
// AcceptString :
"P3240212935" "Rescue the Night Fox"
// SendOffString :
"P1844014803" "The Night Fox hasn't worked actively in years, but he used to be a really remarkable hero. I know you won't let him down."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3323929026" "The Night Fox is still in Crey's clutches!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2213775102" "You have to wonder how many of these beakers and tubes contain the DNA of unwilling heroes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4264690427" "Security Chief Donovan"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2063057040" "The Night Fox's DNA will fill some important gaps in the Protectors' abilities."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1571501403" "Our operation must continue!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hero 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P661563243" "The Night Fox"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P118037143" "All this is about that girl? Sure, I'll tell you about her."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P911697228" "You rescued the Night Fox."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3074073990" "So the girl we've been looking for has been dead for more than ten years? That's a real shame, {HeroName}, a real shame. I'll break it to her mother. Maybe I can pull some strings to get Julianne's body shipped back to the states quickly; that way she can be buried in her family plot. That's the least I can do for her poor mother."
// RandomFameString :
"P390224663" "I saw {HeroName} looking kind of glum earlier. Maybe a mission ended badly?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P133853462" "I just got word from Julianne's mother! According to her, that body that was buried under Julianne's name wasn't hers at all! Now, that may just be grief talking; after years of hoping for her return, Mrs. Thompson may not want to face the fact that her daughter's gone for good. But it got me thinking. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I've got a hunch about who that body might belong to, {HeroName}; now I just need you to check it out.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2054593476" "Check out {ContactName}'s hunch"
// SendOffString :
"P3258464898" "I want you to take a lock of hair from the body over to Cadao Kestrel, the voodoo master. He should be able to perform a ceremony to reveal the dead woman's name."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2664364086" "Take lock of hair to Kestrel"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3101089171" "Kestrel can tell us who was buried in Julianne Thompson's grave."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4195987080" "You'll never learn the truth!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2176813229" "Here's that lock of hair. Don't be spooked by Kestrel; he knows a lot of scary stuff, but he's an honorable man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2550863686" "Thank you, {HeroName}. One moment, and the true name of the dead woman will be revealed. Could you just hand me that bag of chicken bones? Thank you. The name of the dead woman is: <br><br>Clarissa van Dorn? But Clarissa van Dorn is Countess Crey! Van Dorn was her maiden name. {HeroName}, something is very, very awry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1300057751" "I knew it! According to Kestrel's magic, that body belonged to Clarissa van Dorn. That means that Countess Crey isn't the real Clarissa. No. Countess Crey is Julianne Thompson, the girl we've been trying to find. After she found that her prison record prevented her from gaining power the honest way, Julianne killed the real Clarissa, assumed her identity, and married Count Crey under false pretenses! {HeroName}, this is the biggest break we've ever had against the countess. We may even be able to convict her for murder!"
// RandomFameString :
"P4004796197" "{ContactName} says that {HeroName} uncovered something big against Countess Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1038384352" "All right, {HeroName}, this is huge. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Countess Crey is guilty of murder, and you're going to bring her in!</A> I'll put the word out to the police and the media. You go reel her in."
// AcceptString :
"P3104540843" "Bring in Countess Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P1135514474" "My sources think she's inspecting a Crey facility in Brickstown. Check it out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1296630556" "Defeat all agents in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1617187980" "I'm counting on you to bring in Countess Crey!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
