// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P283870911" "Quickly, {HeroName}. We need to keep you off the streets as much as possible. Quigley's story is pretty interesting, that's for sure. If he's right, the launch of CreyComp could be a disaster for more people than just Bill Gates. We'd better check out his facts."
// RandomFameString :
"P3805357363" "What's this world coming to? {HeroName} is a wanted criminal!"

