"P2846420312" "According to that ex-Crey programmer, Howard Quigley, the CreyComp code was shared among three Crey facilities. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You'll need to access the mainframe in each facility in order to get the entire body of code.</A> Then maybe we can figure out if the CreyComp operating system is really part of some Crey plot. Once you've got the full code, take it over to Justine Kelly, the software analyst. She'll tell us what we're dealing with."
// AcceptString :
"P139721677" "Get the CreyComp source code"
// SendOffString :
