// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1934330834" "You have destroyed the original CreyComp code."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2431925045" "Did Justine clue you in on her little secret? That virus she constructed not only wiped out the mind-control OS, CreyComp, it also accessed secret files within the Crey network and sent them to every customer in Crey's e-mail database. Thousands of people just received documents proving that Crey's products are dangerous and addictive, that Crey's been using their computer systems for illegal surveillance, and, best of all, that Countess Crey had those charges against you fabricated. I just got a call from the mayor, {HeroName}, and you've got a clean slate once again!"
// RandomFameString :
"P232039955" "I knew {HeroName} had to be innocent!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Errand11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P387155448" "Thanks to that virus you uploaded to the Crey network, thousands of people just received incriminating Crey documents in their e-mail. Talk about a smoking gun! It's official, {HeroName}. I've been issued a warrant for the arrest of Countess Crey. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now we just need to track her down.</A> We'll have to do it quickly, before she can flee the country."
// AcceptString :
"P3577984737" "Track down Countess Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P1841847699" "The countess still has a lot of loyal agents. I'm sure one of them knows something about her plans."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1205744885" "Find Countess Crey"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4236412879" "We need to track down the countess, and quickly!"

