// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3320799468" "All right. We've got the warrant, and you've located the cave network where Countess Crey is hiding until she can escape the country. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Now all we have to do is go out there and arrest her. Would you care to do the honors?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3682057600" "Arrest Countess Crey"
// SendOffString :
"P1987817733" "Without your hard work and perseverance, we never would have got enough dirt on the countess to make this happen. You should be proud of yourself."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P273196586" "Bust Countess Crey & her guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1948104337" "What are you waiting for? Go out there and bring her in!"

